@startuml
left to right direction
title Medication assistant - Version D (Doctor) - main use cases

actor Doctor
actor "LLM provider\n(Gemini / Groq)" as LLM <<system>>

rectangle "MedRx - Doctor assistant" {
  usecase "Enter drug list" as UC1
  usecase "Check interactions" as UC2
  usecase "Show severity + leaflet quote" as UC3
  usecase "Show full leaflet section" as UC4
  usecase "Handle unknown drug\n(not found)" as UC5
  usecase "Handle LLM rate limit\n(graceful error)" as UC6
}

Doctor --> UC1
Doctor --> UC2
Doctor --> UC4

UC2 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC2 ..> UC5 : <<extend>>
UC2 ..> UC6 : <<extend>>
UC2 --> LLM
UC3 --> LLM

@enduml